# W27, host a (k2): hosts in stag0101 with b; once b went into dng101b1 (another stage group), a walks into the enemies
# alone and falls (it waits near the entrance: a k2 character dies among the enemies, and a dead member goes along
# with the leaver by the side rule): its stage group's game over is the host's (before round I3 the instance ends, host_defeated); a gives
# up and goes home.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander 460 170 15 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
wander 460 170 15 until present=1,frames>=60
log b left for the cave
die until dead
log a defeated
giveup until stage=stagml11,control
log a home after the game over
